    {
      "source": "A <code>BeanDeserializerModifier</code> that registers a custom <a href=\"PersistentEntityJackson2Module.UriStringDeserializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>PersistentEntityJackson2Module.UriStringDeserializer</code></a> for association properties\nof <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "一个用于为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 的关联属性注册自定义 <a href=\"PersistentEntityJackson2Module.UriStringDeserializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>PersistentEntityJackson2Module.UriStringDeserializer</code></a> 的 <code>BeanDeserializerModifier</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Custom <code>StdDeserializer</code> to interpret <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> values as URIs and resolve them using a\n<a href=\"../../core/UriToEntityConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core\"><code>UriToEntityConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "自定义 <code>StdDeserializer</code> 以将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 值解释为 URI，并使用\n<a href=\"../../core/UriToEntityConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core\"><code>UriToEntityConverter</code></a> 进行解析。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "since 5.0, in favor of <a href=\"PersistentEntityJacksonModule.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>PersistentEntityJacksonModule</code></a>.",
      "translation": "自 5.0 版本起，推荐使用<a href=\"PersistentEntityJacksonModule.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>PersistentEntityJacksonModule</code></a>。",
